														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2678464">
									

<p>Reading this brought up some feelings of bittersweet nostalgia for my /x/ days. Hours spent pouring through creepypasta, most of it terrible. SCPs and Holders really were the shining stars of those days, and I'll never forget the fear and wonder about a dark and mysterious world that the Holders made me feel.</p>
<p>I find myself saddened by the Holders site going down. I hadn't read them in years, but they really were fellow pioneers in the genre of internet short-horror fiction. This tale captured that feeling perfectly.</p>
<p>+1</p>

